L1: Building strength, endurance, and mobility using an astaxanthin formulation with functional training in elderly
L2: Journal of Cachexia, Sarcopenia and Muscle (2018)
L3: Sophia Z. Liu, Amir S. Ali, Matthew D. Campbell, Kevin Kilroy, Eric G. Shankland, Baback Roshanravan, David J. Marcinek, Kevin E. Conley
