L684: Acknowledgements
L685: We thank the volunteers who participated in this study for their time and dedication. Chessa Goss coordinated the study. Will Siegell analysed muscle CSA. Matt van Doren, Claudia Kumai, and Angela Modelski provided exercise training and clinical assessments. Nelly Nicklason provided comments. The authors certify that they comply with the ethical guidelines for authorship and publishing of the Journal of Cachexia, Sarcopenia and Muscle. 44  This work was supported by Astavita, Inc.; National Institutes of Health grants (T32 AG000057, UL1TR000423, 1S10OD016201, K23DK099442); Department of Radiology and Office of the Provost of the University of Washington, and the Prevention Center at the Fred Hutchison Cancer Research Center. The content of this publication is solely the responsibility of the authors and does not necessarily represent the official views of the National Institutes of Health.
